{"product_id":"monster-high-happy-howlidays-a-creepy-cool-activity-book","title":"Monster High: Happy Howlidays!: A Creepy-Cool Activity Book","description":"\u003cp\u003eHappy Howlidays from Monster High!When the howlidays are in swing, give all your ghoulfriends the most drop-dead gore-geous gifts. Decorate your gifts with freaky-chic gift wrapping and scary-sweet cards! Join your favorite monsters-Draculaura, Cleo, Frankie, Ghoulia, Lagoona, Clawdeen, and more-as they share some creeperific craft ideas with you! From electric glow-in-the-dark wrapping to sugar skull cards, your howliday gifts are sure to be scary-cool! Now break out the tape and scissors for some creeperific craft time!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 216 x 279\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Pollygeist Danescary\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780316277099\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 32\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45359422865561,"sku":"BLK-3-9780316277099","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6813a105d84dc_Monster_High-_Happy_Howlidays_-_A_Creepy-Cool_Activity_Book_Pollygeist_Danescary.jpg?v=1752150969","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/monster-high-happy-howlidays-a-creepy-cool-activity-book","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}